{"id": "68687", "title": "首长，求包养", "author": "泼茶香", "category": "肉文辣文", "count": 11, "available": 0, "cover": "", "status": "已完成", "source": "files/article/info/68/68687.htm", "intro": "当顾泽宇不知道她就是首长们口中的“小公主”时\r\n他的目标就是将这个女人训趴下\r\n当韩菱纱不知道他就是爸爸叔叔们口中的“不简单”时\r\n她的愿望就是将这个男人踩死在脚下\r\n\r\n当顾泽宇知道了她就是“小公主”时\r\n他的想法就是抢回家慢慢教育\r\n当韩菱纱知道他就是“不简单”时\r\n她的战术就是赶紧扑倒慢慢消化\r\n\r\n内容标签：军旅 高干 都市情缘", "base": "files/article/html/68/68687", "chapters": [{"title": "1-5", "file": "10542634.html", "available": false}, {"title": "6-10", "file": "10542635.html", "available": false}, {"title": "11-15", "file": "10542636.html", "available": false}, {"title": "16-20", "file": "10542637.html", "available": false}, {"title": "21-25", "file": "10542638.html", "available": false}, {"title": "26-30", "file": "10542639.html", "available": false}, {"title": "31-35", "file": "10542640.html", "available": false}, {"title": "36-40", "file": "10542641.html", "available": false}, {"title": "41-45", "file": "10542642.html", "available": false}, {"title": "46-50", "file": "10542643.html", "available": false}, {"title": "51-54完结", "file": "10542644.html", "available": false}]}